                                "sense_id": "dd114bb0-abdd-3ae0-b6a0-130013b06217",
                                "text": "In sum, this was an arena where rigid role definitions discandied, on stage and off, reflecting—and stirring—the anxiety of an age when social mobility reared up from an emerging market economy."
